            "line": 346,
            "text": "theorem constructed_means (a m d p δ : ℝ) (ha : 0 < a) (hd : d ≠ 0) (hδ : 0 < δ) :\n    (∫ φ in (0 : ℝ)..1, constructedA a m d p δ ha hd hδ φ) = a ∧\n      (∫ φ in (0 : ℝ)..1, constructedC a m d p δ ha hd hδ φ) = a * m"
